id: spiritual-weapon
name: Spiritual Weapon
kind: crafting
slots: 1
prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance or Use Magic
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Also a Crystal Ball. Needs 2+ Ranks in Clairvoyance or Use Magic.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: This Weapon is also treated as a Crystal Ball (see — Basic Items).
text: >
  Spiritual Weapon: This Weapon enables using magic to remotely view your enemies.
  –Weapon Type: Any
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance or Use Magic
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: This Weapon is also treated as a Crystal Ball (see — Basic Items).

---

# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Crystal Ball is not in this system yet - put off by the table. When it is, this Weapon is
# one too, while its wielder has 2+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance or Use Magic.
